# created by fftool

units real
boundary p p p

atom_style full
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic

pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 9.0 9.0
pair_modify tail yes
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-5

read_data data.lmp

include pair.lmp

group dissolved type 3 4
group solvent type 5 6
group cluster type 1 2
group Rest type 1 2 3 4 5 6

fix SHAKE solvent shake 0.0001 20 0 b 1 a 1

neighbor 2.0 bin

compute thermo_ke all ke
